  "evidence": "Original observations show a sustained E and U step at ~582, followed by a return near 638–640 (U drops sharply at 639–640, E drops at 640). P1 (582–638) aligns with onset and return in E/U; interior shows stable offset. P2 (588–632) is nested, but its small onset offsets (E: -1.17, U: +1.03) contradict the large observed steps (~12 MAD E, ~18 MAD U). Residuals after subtracting P1’s onset (Hypothesis P1) show smooth motion without residual platform; subtracting P2 leaves large residual offset. Thus only P1 represents a genuine temporary platform.",
